    "title": "Tanners rally for a season-opening win - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anne Marie Tobin ,\n1 days ago SOMERVILLE — Last year, Peabody’s football team waited 10 weeks before putting a game in the win column. Once the Tanners fell behind, their fate was sealed. This team, however, wasted no time in making a bold statement that things are going to be different, coming from behind to defeat the Somerville Highlanders, 40-16, Friday night at Dilboy Stadium. Read full article",
